  "prefLabel": "Plc 1602.02 Cooperate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1602.02 “Cooperate” means to provide information requested by an investigator during an investigation and to answer any questions posed by the investigator in order to enable the executive director to determine compliance with RSA 326-M and Plc 1600.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
